  "name": "Armor Modifications",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/equipment/chest/breastplate-banded-steel-grey.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 9th level, you learn how to use your gadgeteer mods to specially modify your Mechanical Armor. That armor now counts as separate items for the purposes of your Mods feature: armor, boots, helmet, and the armor's special weapon. Each of those items can bear one of your mods, and the mods transfer over if you change your armor's model with the Armor Model feature. In addition, the maximum number of items you can mod at once increases by 2, but those extra items must be part of your Mechanical Armor.</p>",
